      "releaseNotes": "💖 Fuel Independent Development, Built with Love!\nIntroducing a beautiful, premium Donate Button right inside the settings screen! If SpendWise helps you track your budgets and ingestion rules, consider supporting ad-free, secure tools. It opens all your favorite UPI apps directly, featuring preset quick chips (₹50, ₹100, ₹250, ₹500, ₹1000) and a stunning pulsing animation!\n\n🎉 A Particle Celebration for Legends!\nEvery successful support transfer triggers a gorgeous Confetti Explosion falling down your screen in real-time! Our custom particle physics engine animates hundreds of colorful, rotating confetti pieces at a butter-smooth 60fps to express our deepest gratitude.\n\n🛡️ Smart Bank Verification Fallback\nSince modern banking apps restrict transaction status reporting for personal UPI peer-to-peer VPAs, SpendWise incorporates an empathetic self-verification backup. If your payment goes through but the banking app returns unconfirmed, a warm card lets you confirm and celebrate anyway!",
